4L332.7,89.5L343.1,85.0L346.7,85.5L358.8,84.3L363.0,86.1L361.9,78.0L369.5,77.0L372.3,78.6L373.7,84.3L377.0,88.2L377.9,94.5L375.6,99.5L372.0,103.4L375.4,107.3L370.0,114.3L375.9,111.4L384.1,104.3L383.8,98.6L382.4,91.6L379.9,85.2L381.0,78.2L385.8,73.6L397.8,71.4L392.8,63.4L397.3,62.7L402.3,64.3L409.4,70.7L416.7,75.5L424.5,79.3L416.9,87.3L408.0,92.5L404.3,98.4Z\" fill=\"#009a44\" fill-opacity=\".16\" stroke=\"#2bd47a\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></div></div><div class=\"gal3\"><img src=\"https://staging.tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-unnamed-80-1200.webp\" alt=\"Cyclists riding toward an Irish Victorian mansion. - Cigala Cycling Tours\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://staging.tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-unnamed-79-1200.webp\" alt=\"Group of cyclists posing at Cliffs of Moher - Cigala Cycling Tours\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://staging.tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-unnamed-78-1200.webp\" alt=\"Two cyclists high-fiving on a scenic Irish road - Cigala Cycling Tours\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://staging.tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-unnamed-77-1200.webp\" alt=\"Cyclist riding uphill on a coastal road by the sea. - Cigala Cycling Tours\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://staging.tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-unnamed-76-1200.webp\" alt=\"Aerial winding green road. - Cigala Cycling Tours\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://staging.tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-unnamed-75-1200.webp\" alt=\"Cyclists on a mountain road - Cigala Cycling Tours\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section>\n  <div class=\"in\">\n    <div class=\"head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">Ireland</div><h2>Why Ireland?</h2><div class=\"bar\"></div></div></div>\n    <div class=\"prose dprose\"><p>Quiet roads with little traffic<br>Stunning coastal and mountain scenery<br>World-famous Wild Atlantic Way routes<br>Traditional Irish culture and hospitality<br>Incredible food, cafés, and local pubs<br>Perfect roads for endurance riding and exploration<br>Suitable for all levels of cyclists</p></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section>\n  <div class=\"in\">\n    <div class=\"head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">Ireland</div><h2>Why ride Ireland?</h2><div class=\"bar\"></div></div></div>\n    <div class=\"prose dprose\"><p>✓ Wild Atlantic Way<br>✓ Connemara National Park<br>✓ The Burren<br>✓ Ring of Kerry<br>✓ Wicklow Mountains<br>✓ Historic castles and villages<br>✓ Traditional Irish hospitality<br>✓ Spectacular coastal roads</p></div><div class=\"gal3\"><img src=\"https://staging.tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-unnamed-74-1200.webp\" alt=\"Three cyclists ride along coastal road. - Cigala Cycling Tours\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://staging.tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-unnamed-73-1200.webp\" alt=\"Winding mountain road through lush green Irish hills. - Cigala Cycling Tours\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://staging.tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-unnamed-72-1200.webp\" alt=\"Three cyclists ride on a wet country road. - Cigala Cycling Tours\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section>\n  <div class=\"in\">\n    <div class=\"head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">Good to know</div><h2>IRELAND FACTS</h2><div class=\"bar\"></div></div></div>\n    <div class=\"facts4\"><div class=\"panel fact\"><div class=\"ic\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 21s-6-5.3-6-10a6 6 0 0 1 12 0c0 4.7-6 10-6 10z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"11\" r=\"2.2\"/></svg></div><div><h3>Location</h3><p>Located on the western edge of Europe, Ireland is known for its dramatic coastlines, rolling green landscapes, charming villages, and rich cycling heritage. From the rugged Wild Atlantic Way to the scenic Wicklow Mountains, Ireland offers some of the most beautiful and peaceful roads in Europe.​</p></div></div><div class=\"panel fact\"><div class=\"ic\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M12 2.5v2.5M12 19v2.5M2.5 12H5M19 12h2.5M5.3 5.3l1.8 1.8M16.9 16.9l1.8 1.8M5.3 18.7l1.8-1.8M16.9 7.1l1.8-1.8\"/></svg></div><div><h3>Climate</h3><p>reland enjoys a mild maritime climate, making it an excellent cycling destination from spring through autumn. Temperatures are generally comfortable for riding, with cool mornings, pleasant afternoons, and lush green landscapes throughout the season. While the weather can be changeable, it is all part of the authentic Irish experience.</p></div></div><div class=\"panel fact\"><div class=\"ic\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 3h8l-.5 6a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-7 0L8 3zM12 12.5V20M8.5 20.5h7\"/></svg></div><div><h3>Cuisine</h3><p>Irish cuisine has evolved dramatically in recent years, combining traditional recipes with high-quality local ingredients. Expect fresh seafood, artisan cheeses, hearty breakfasts, homemade breads, and world-famous pub meals. Ireland's café culture has also grown significantly, making it a fantastic destination for cyclists who appreciate great coffee and local food.</p></div></div><div class=\"panel fact\"><div class=\"ic\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.5 19.5 9 8l4 6.5 2.5-3.5 6 8.5z\"/></svg></div><div><h3>Terrain</h3><p>Ireland offers a diverse mix of terrain suitable for all types of cyclists. Expect rolling countryside roads, coastal routes with stunning ocean views, short punchy climbs, and longer mountain ascents in areas such as Wicklow, Kerry, and Connemara. The roads are generally quiet, scenic, and ideal for both endurance riding and adventure cycling.​</p></div></div></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section>\n  <div class=\"in\">\n    <div class=\"head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">Custom tours</div><h2>MOST POPULAR IRELAND CUSTOM TOURS</h2><div class=\"bar\"></div></div></div>\n    <div class=\"prose dprose\"><p>Every custom tour is unique. Explore our most popular Ireland itineraries and let us tailor them to your group, dates and riding goals.</p></div><div class=\"fchips\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Filter by tour type\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"fchip on\" data-f=\"all\"><span class=\"fd\"></span>All</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"fchip\" data-f=\"road\"><span class=\"fd\"></span>Road</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"fchip\" data-f=\"gravel\"><span class=\"fd\"></span>Gravel</button></div><div class=\"tgrid\"><article class=\"tcard dtour\" data-k=\"road\"><a class=\"ph\" href=\"/trips/private-trips/\"><img src=\"https://staging.tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-pretty-pink-XvPsA9Riev4-unsplash-900.webp\" alt=\"Pisa Bike Tours | Cigala Cycling\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">Road</span></span></a><div class=\"tx\"><h2>Wild Atlantic Way</h2><div class=\"desc\"><p>Ride Ireland's spectacular west coast, combining rugged Atlantic scenery, quiet roads, dramatic climbs and charming coastal villages.</p></div><div class=\"ctas one\"><a class=\"btn btn-go\" href=\"/trips/private-trips/\">Enquire this tour →</a></div></div></article><article class=\"tcard dtour\" data-k=\"road\"><a class=\"ph\" href=\"/trips/private-trips/\"><img src=\"https://staging.tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-rahul-chakraborty-5aN2I852PTs-unsplash-900.webp\" alt=\"Cycling Tours Cinque Terre\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">Road</span></span></a><div class=\"tx\"><h2>Wicklow Mountains Cycling Escape</h2><div class=\"desc\"><p>Explore Ireland's premier cycling destination, with quiet mountain roads, challenging climbs and beautiful valleys.</p></div><div class=\"ctas one\"><a class=\"btn btn-go\" href=\"/trips/private-trips/\">Enquire this tour →</a></div></div></article><article class=\"tcard dtour\" data-k=\"road\"><a class=\"ph\" href=\"/trips/private-trips/\"><img src=\"https://staging.tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-dji_fly_20260528_164546_382_1779985688665_photo_optimized-900.webp\" alt=\"Cycling Tours Tuscany\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">Road</span></span></a><div class=\"tx\"><h2>Mizen Head to Malin Head</h2><div class=\"desc\"><p>Cycle from Ireland's southernmost point to its northernmost, crossing the entire island through remote roads and rolling countryside.</p></div><div class=\"ctas one\"><a class=\"btn btn-go\" href=\"/trips/private-trips/\">Enquire this tour →</a></div></div></article><article class=\"tcard dtour\" data-k=\"gravel\"><a class=\"ph\" href=\"/trips/private-trips/\"><img src=\"https://staging.tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-francesca-fabian-UgxtJcZwCus-unsplash-900.webp\" alt=\"Wicklow Gravel Cycling\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag gravel\">Gravel</span></span></a><div class=\"tx\"><h2>WICKLOW GRAVEL</h2><div class=\"desc\"><p>Explore the wild side of the Wicklow Mountains on gravel, riding remote forest tracks, mountain roads and spectacular valleys just south of Dublin.</p></div><div class=\"ctas one\"><a class=\"btn btn-go\" href=\"/trips/private-trips/\">Enquire this tour →</a></div></div></article><article class=\"tcard dtour\" data-k=\"road\"><a class=\"ph\" href=\"/trips/private-trips/\"><img src=\"https://staging.tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-1620932-900.webp\" alt=\"Italy&#x27;s Coast To Coast\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">Road</span></span></a><div class=\"tx\"><h2>Giant&#x27;s Causeway &amp; Antrim Coast</h2><div class=\"desc\"><p>Ride Northern Ireland's spectacular Causeway Coast, with dramatic coastal roads, rolling climbs, historic villages and the iconic Giant's Causeway.</p></div><div class=\"ctas o